      "-device",
      "virtio-scsi-pci",
      "-drive",
      "if=none,id=cd,media=cdrom,readonly=on,file=/src/build/CHOS-ARM64.iso",
      "-device",
      "scsi-cd,drive=cd",
      "-boot",
      "order=d"
    ]
  }
]
Thirty-five QEMU cases, thirteen host programs (both ELF payloads checked), both ISO repeatability checks and independent disk verification passed.
